  "definition": "Individualized Resiliency and Recovery Oriented Services (IROS)",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-03-28",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for He-M 426) #5433, eff 7-2-92, EXPIRED: 7-2-98 New. #7088, eff 8-31-99; ss by #8867, eff 4-13-07; ss by #9285, eff 9-30-08; ss by #9581, eff 10-24-09; ss by #12154, eff 3-28-17",
